** ======================================================================
** MATERIAL PROPERTY DEFINITION: 16MnCr5 (EN 10084 Case Hardening Steel)
** Unified Thermo-Elasto-Plastic and Phase Transformation Deck
** Compatible with sequentially coupled Heat Transfer and Mechanical FEA
** Units: mm, s, tonne, N, MPa (N/mm2), mJ (N*mm), C
** Nominal composition: C=0.16%, Si=0.25%, Mn=1.15%, Cr=0.95%
** Transformation temperatures: Ac1=734 C, Ac3=840 C, Bs=617 C, Ms=425 C
** Solidus = 1490 C, Liquidus = 1515 C, Latent Heat = 2.70E+11 mJ/tonne
** ======================================================================
